{"path":"io/basic_streambuf/getloc","title":"std::basic_streambuf<CharT,Traits>::getloc","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_streambuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>getloc","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/getloc","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the associated locale.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a> getloc<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the associated locale.\n</p><p>The associated locale is the value supplied to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/pubimbue\">pubimbue()</a></span> on the last call, or, if that function has not been called, the value of the global locale (<span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\">std::locale</a></span>) at the time of the construction of the streambuf.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The associated locale.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/pubimbue\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>pubimbue</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  changes the associated locale and invokes <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">imbue<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">